WEBVTT

00:00:06.612 --> 00:00:07.825
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> And who are you?

00:00:08.171 --> 00:00:10.945
<v><b>Linda:</b></v> Um, Dad, this is Dylan.

00:00:11.607 --> 00:00:14.362
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> What are you doing here, Dylan?

00:00:14.542 --> 00:00:23.530
<v><b>Dylan:</b></v> Well, er… you see… Linda and I wanted to do our homework together.

00:00:24.103 --> 00:00:29.565
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Oh, did you? And what kind of homework was it, exactly?